OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in court as bomb squad
OL,4,Aevacuate homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FBomb disposal experts have taken over
OL,7,Fthe search of a Sheffield property
OL,8,Fafter residents living nearby were
OL,9,Fevacuated.
OL,11,FA 328ft (100m) cordon remains in place
OL,12,Fat Mapplebeck Road in High Green.
OL,14,FA forensic police search began on
OL,15,FFriday. On Monday, 35-year-old Rachel
OL,16,FHale appeared at Sheffield Magistrates'
OL,17,FCourt charged with an offence under the
OL,18,FExplosive Substances Act 1883. She was
OL,19,Fremanded in custody. Neighbours were
OL,20,Fevacuated on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
