OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in court as bomb squad
OL,4,Aevacuate homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it did not
OL,7,F"underestimate" the impact of the
OL,8,Fevacuation on residents and that
OL,9,Fordnance experts would advise when it
OL,10,Fwas safe for them to return to their
OL,11,Fhomes.
